+/// The `fa trajectory tail` follower, split out of
+/// [_runTrajectoryCommand] to keep the command dispatcher under the
+/// CRAP ratchet (CC ≤ 12). Prints the whole-ledger backfill [records]
+/// first, then polls until interrupted.
